      "text": "Conjuntos (plano de Fano)\np0 → {p0, p1, p2}\np1 → {p1, p3, p5}\np2 → {p2, p3, p6}\np3 → {p0, p3, p4}\np4 → {p2, p4, p5}\np5 → {p0, p5, p6}\np6 → {p1, p4, p6}",
